{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晨（3日）7時許，警方接獲途人報案，指發現新油麻地避風塘對開約300米海面有人形物體飄浮。</p><p>警方及救援人員接報到場搜索，其後救起一名男子，由消防輪送上岸，救護人員經檢驗證實男子當場身亡。</p><p>警方正調查事主身分及墮海原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:51.856233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:32:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:22.703273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:13.202324+00:00","content_hash":"53e0bdfd2fcfc108c30ee54d93344b5eb81c1fea73d4985c9e754f5b09d701db","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}